# train_16: every pickup at A must complete one of two options for that
# pickup: either reach inspection station B 1-2 steps later and then
# eventually reach delivery bay C at or after that B, or reach overflow
# dock D at that step or later. Different pickups may choose differently.
# Vacuously satisfied if A never occurs.
every(A, any_of(
    within(1, 2, B) then visit(C),
    visit(D)
))
